title: mf slow list
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Slow log]]
kind: reference
summary: List the slow operations, newest first — the default

The newest entries first, both processes merged: [[Diagnosing a slow operation]].
`--since` takes the durations of `mf trash prune -d` (`30m`, `2h`, `7d`), `--op`
keeps the entries whose operation contains a substring, `--json` prints the raw
entries one per line.
